Domain Name: NMG.com
OUs Created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security Groups Created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users
Purpose of Each OU:
Finance - This department represents the team responsible for all fiancial, accounting and legal matters of NMG.
HR - This department represents the human resources team, responsible for the human operations and plays a big part of onboarding and offboarding for NMG.
IT - This department represents the information technology team, responsible for the technical operations, incident resolution and security practices of NMG. 
Operations - This department represents the team responsible for resource management, quality control and marketing for NMG.
